            "first_seen_pages": [
              {
                "id": "partner_ajie_long",
                "text": "他和阿婕結了婚。兩個人守著日子，沒有要孩子。\n二十年過去，她剛過四十歲就倒下了。查出是癌症，惡化得很快，沒幾個月人就沒了。\n接著輪到他。一模一樣的病，走得也很急。",
                "narrative_beats": [
                  "marriage",
                  "no_children",
                  "twenty_years",
                  "died_early_forties",
                  "spouse_dies_first",
                  "died_of_cancer",
                  "died_rapidly",
                  "protagonist_same_illness"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "repeat_pages": [
              {
                "id": "partner_ajie_short",
                "text": "他與阿婕成婚。二十年後她先因病離世，不久後他也得同病去世。",
                "narrative_beats": [
                  "marriage",
                  "spouse_dies_first",
                  "protagonist_same_illness"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "awei",
            "when": {
              "flag": "invited_awei"
            },
            "first_seen_pages": [
              {
                "id": "partner_awei_long",
                "text": "他和阿薇成了家。小鎮的日子平靜漫長，身邊一直沒有添小孩。\n二十年後，阿薇在四十出頭那年染上重病。診斷出來是癌症，病情惡化得毫無預兆，很快就撒手走了。\n沒隔多久，他也躺進了同樣的病房，死於同一個病。",
                "narrative_beats": [
                  "marriage",
                  "no_children",
                  "twenty_years",
                  "died_early_forties",
                  "spouse_dies_first",
                  "died_of_cancer",
                  "died_rapidly",
                  "protagonist_same_illness"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "repeat_pages": [
              {
                "id": "partner_awei_short",
                "text": "他與阿薇成婚，膝下無子。二十年後阿薇先因病故去，他也因同樣的病隨之離世。",
                "narrative_beats": [
                  "marriage",
                  "spouse_dies_first",
                  "protagonist_same_illness"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "none",
            "fallback": true,
            "first_seen_pages": [
              {
                "id": "partner_none_long",
                "text": "他始終沒有成家，獨自一人在山泉閣過了二十年。",
                "narrative_beats": [
                  "no_marriage",
                  "single_twenty_years"
